  {
   "id": "note-moe",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 700,
   "y": 1609,
   "width": 700,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "**Two FFNs per layer.** The dense MLP (17.8M) runs on every token — the card's \"1 shared\" expert. The router reads h *before* any norm; the experts read pre_feedforward_layernorm_2(h). Experts are stored fused: gate_up [128, 1408, 2816], down [128, 2816, 704]."
  }
